# Reminders

## bun-browser CLI

`bun-browser` is a shell alias:

```bash
alias bun-browser='bun /Users/hesdx/Documents/toolings/bun-browser/dist/cli.js'
```

When running commands in non-interactive shells (or if the alias is unavailable), use the full path:

```bash
bun /Users/hesdx/Documents/toolings/bun-browser/dist/cli.js <command>
```
